  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Crowdfunding for Cultural Heritage</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP aims to raise funds through a global crowdfunding to rebuild and revitalize the cultural heritage in 11 provinces of T&#xfc;rkiye affected by the earthquake. The vision of this campaign is to create a sustainable and impactful response to the devastating earthquake affecting both tangible and intangible cultural heritage in T&#xfc;rkiye by mobilizing local and international communities, individuals, Turkish diaspora, national and multinational private sector companies and organizations worldwide.</narrative>
  </description>
